              "pp_sponsor_id": "NIAP",
              "community_id": null,
              "status": "Publishing",
              "sunset_date": null,
              "pp_overview": "<p>The scope of the Wireless Local Area Network (WLAN) Client&nbsp;PP-Module&nbsp;is to describe the security functionality of a&nbsp;WLAN&nbsp;Client in terms of [CC] and to define functional and assurance requirements for such products. This&nbsp;PP-Module&nbsp;is intended for use with the following&nbsp;Base-PPs:</p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li>General Purpose Operating System (GPOS) Protection Profile, Version 4.2.1 and Version 4.3</li>\r\n<li>Mobile Device Fundamentals (MDF) Protection Profile, Version 3.2 and Version 3.3</li>\r\n</ul>",
